  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la Transicion Energetica y a la Promocion de Inversiones en el Sector Energetico de Ecuador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Energy Transition and the Promotion of Investments in Ecuadors Energy Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es apoyar los esfuerzos del Gobierno de Ecuador (GdE) hacia una transicin energtica justa, promoviendo la inversin pblica y privada. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) apoyar la descarbonizacin del sector energtico, promoviendo fuentes de ERNC, fuentes alternativas de generacin, medidas de EE y gestin de la demanda, integracin regional y movilidad elctrica; (ii) aumentar la participacin privada en la prestacin del servicio elctrico; (iii) avanzar en el acceso universal a la electricidad; y (iv) reducir las brechas de gnero y de personas con discapacidad del sector elctrico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to support the efforts of the Government of Ecuador to strengthen and promote public and private investment toward a just energy transition. The specific objectives are: (i) to support the decarbonization of the energy sector by promoting non-conventional renewable energy (NCRE) sources, alternative sources of generation, energy efficiency, and demand management measures, regional integration and electric mobility; (ii) to increase the private sector participation in the provision of electricity; (iii) to advance within the process of achieving universal access to electricity; (iv) and to reduce gender gaps in the energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
